---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';

const locations = ['Bahamas', 'Jamaica', 'Antigua', 'Tortola', 'St John', 'Eleuthera'];
---
<BaseLayout title="Projects | Bauhu" description="Bauhu project archive and case studies.">
  <SiteHeader />
  <main class="bg-paper pt-32">
    <section class="section-pad">
      <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-site gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr]">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow text-clay">Projects</p>
          <h1 class="mt-5 max-w-4xl font-display text-5xl leading-tight md:text-7xl">Real projects are the proof of the system.</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-7 text-lg leading-8 text-ink/70">
          <p>The Bauhu project archive will bring together completed homes, active projects and legacy site material into a clearer set of case studies.</p>
          <p>Each project page should explain location, model route, site conditions, delivery constraints and the role Bauhu played in the build.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-pad bg-mist">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-site">
        <p class="eyebrow text-clay">Locations</p>
        <h2 class="mt-5 max-w-3xl font-display text-4xl leading-tight md:text-6xl">A clearer archive for existing search value.</h2>
        <div class="mt-12 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
          {locations.map((location) => (
            <article class="flex min-h-64 items-end bg-forest p-7 text-paper">
              <div>
                <p class="eyebrow text-stone">Project location</p>
                <h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl">{location}</h3>
              </div>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-pad bg-paper">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-site text-center">
        <p class="eyebrow text-clay">Migration note</p>
        <h2 class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-3xl font-display text-4xl leading-tight md:text-6xl">Old project pages should become useful case studies, not dead redirects.</h2>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-ink/70">The rebuild should preserve useful legacy project search traffic while improving the visitor experience and making each project easier to understand.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
</BaseLayout>
